=== Analytical gas projection for _countActiveLoans ===
  Per iteration (one element of agentLoans):
    - MLOAD loanIds[i]                       :    3 gas
    - SLOAD on loans[id].state (cold)        : 2100 gas
    - SLOAD on loans[id].state (warm)        :  100 gas
    - Hash + branch + counter                :  ~50 gas
    - Memory expansion / copy cost           :  ~10 gas / element
  → cold per-iter ~2160 gas, warm ~160 gas

  agentLoans[] copied to memory at function entry:
    - copy cost ~3 gas/word + quadratic memory expansion
    - dominant for N > ~512 entries due to memory expansion quadratic term

  Base       block gas limit 30,000,000:
    brick threshold (all cold) : 13,726 loans
    brick threshold (all warm) : 185,312 loans (theoretical max)
  Arbitrum   block gas limit 32,000,000:
    brick threshold (all cold) : 14,652 loans
    brick threshold (all warm) : 197,812 loans (theoretical max)
  Arc        block gas limit 32,000,000:
    brick threshold (all cold) : 14,652 loans
    brick threshold (all warm) : 197,812 loans (theoretical max)

